[{"title":"题南郭别业 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"褰裳涉三山，泛驾骋九州。\n秦皇与周穆，往事良悠悠。\n伊人事卜筑，乃在青门陬。\n寒泉瑩碧沼，丛篁间绿畴。\n菰蒲覆深浅，鸂鷘信沉浮。\n岂云甘离索，聊以供息游。\n空潭潜赤鲤，巨壑壑苍虬。\n愿展云中翼，蓬蒿安足留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其一 之推","author":"佘翔","text":"绵上山何高，千盘临绛水。\n有蛇伏其中，依依母与子。\n岂无从龙功，贪天窃所耻。\n悬书在宫门，山中呼不起。\n烈火被林皋，象焚良以齿。\n生岂薄君恩，所愿从母死。\n峨峨山上祠，郁郁松与梓。\n至今寒食时，行人伤遗垒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其二 季子","author":"佘翔","text":"延陵有宝剑，解挂徐君墓。\n但酬一片心，安知存与故。\n让国追夷齐，千乘非所顾。\n岂复问遗金，负薪嗟道路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其三 屈原","author":"佘翔","text":"三闾不可作，九歌有遗编。\n伊昔仕宗国，岂不炳几先。\n青蝇一坠耳，明月亦弃捐。\n离骚空缱绻，利口急相煎。\n娥眉嫉众女，萧艾茂兰荃。\n侘傺古如此，非今独怃然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其四 荆轲","author":"佘翔","text":"秦皇吞六国，蚕食下山东。\n燕丹求壮士，易水歌悲风。\n慷慨入咸阳，积诚贯白虹。\n千金怀匕首，督亢图易穷。\n报秦计不就，倚柱气何雄。\n智哉张子房，潜击秦沙中。\n十日索不得，翊汉成大功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其五 韩信","author":"佘翔","text":"楚汉方龙斗，雌雄未可知。\n淮阴起屠钓，佐汉一定之。\n垓下兵已破，龙准偃旌旗。\n楚人威震主，云梦亟相随。\n兔死走狗烹，鼎镬所不辞。\n妇言赤三族，韩彭良足悲。\n以此感壮士，贻笑屠中儿。\n饥从漂母饭，千金报不移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其六 灌夫","author":"佘翔","text":"长安豪杰窟，权贵势相移。\n今朝武安客，昨日事魏其。\n一请城南曲，嫌隙良在兹。\n所嗟俱戚里，安用倾夺为。\n将军善使酒，骂坐且为谁。\n一朝论弃市，笑杀颍川儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其七 龚胜","author":"佘翔","text":"炎祚既云微，五侯起专政。\n成都怀异心，敢窃太阿柄。\n亦有金縢书，居摄附姬圣。\n传玺胁后宫，新室朔改正。\n乃徵龚大夫，大夫固称病。\n印绶岂不荣，所耻事二姓。\n草玄者何心，竟乃作符命。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其八 武侯","author":"佘翔","text":"孔明心佐汉，长啸出隆中。\n三分方割据，虎视竞相雄。\n运筹劳旦夕，岂不誓匪躬。\n关张不可作，帷幄难为功。\n五丈原头石，汉室已将终。\n即今前后表，读罢泪无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其九 靖节","author":"佘翔","text":"栗里有高人，浮云无所累。\n有酒但相招，陶然?一醉。\n采菊坐东篱，慨然发长喟。\n身世两悠悠，那得长相寄。\n白日梦羲皇，千载一高视。\n解带谢时人，风流此未坠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史十首 其十 祢衡","author":"佘翔","text":"汉运昔云颓，烟云四塞起。\n魏武奋鹰扬，群策皆披靡。\n雄辨哉祢衡，猖狂无与比。\n阿瞒非所论，馀子安足齿。\n江夏褊心人，豪强甘杀死。\n至今鹦鹉名，遗恨沧浪水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题戴氏风泽山房 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"谁栽千树橘，况近百花庄。\n何用愚名谷，只宜醉作乡。\n行藏高卧稳，岁月著书长。\n兴到来看竹，无劳枉报章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题戴氏风泽山房 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"结屋松林下，终朝独闭关。\n猖狂知浊酒，摇落对青山。\n种树荷锄去，寻僧采药还。\n眷兹招隐地，倘许数跻攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕舟中","author":"佘翔","text":"银汉迎仙佩，金飙动客舟。\n江湖逢此夕，砧杵报新秋。\n尘世伤萍梗，清宵看女牛。\n班姬团扇赋，吟罢不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真州送林明府携家还乡 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"故园何处是，闽海路漫漫。\n儿女天涯泪，穷愁世路难。\n新诗工谢朓，往事拙潘安。\n一卧秋江上，鲈鱼满钓竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真州送林明府携家还乡 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"枫林摇落候，有客赋将归。\n湖海十年梦，星霜两鬓稀。\n田园存晚计，萝薜遂初衣。\n回首云霄迥，天涯万事非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真州送林明府携家还乡 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"携家寻旧隐，岂为鹿门期。\n客久薪如桂，愁来鬓有丝。\n风尘悲荏苒，戎马苦驱驰。\n归去盟猿鹤，岩居更不移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河上即事 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"淮南飘泊者，秋水信轻舠。\n萍梗还千里，风尘感二毛。\n露滋葭菼冷，天阔雁鸿高。\n蹈海吾何敢，来观八月涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河上即事 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"岂学庄生傲，聊为汗漫游。\n衔杯捐万事，得句倚扁舟。\n大汉秋风起，层城海气流。\n长歌招隐赋，桂树暂淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河上即事 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"秋色欺霜鬓，飘零胡不归。\n沧洲吾道在，白眼世情非。\n有客歌丛桂，何人问少微。\n但看沙上鸟，来去总忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河上即事 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"惨淡浮云色，萧条万里情。\n风尘何落魄，湖海且逃名。\n丧乱依刘表，离骚赋屈平。\n陆沉无不可，归去问柴荆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河上即事 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"浪迹缘何事，风帆任所之。\n沧波含暝色，白露脆秋枝。\n海市渔灯闹，江天雁影迟。\n徘徊良夜月，赖有手中卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河上即事 其六","author":"佘翔","text":"偃蹇嗟吾道，支离笑此身。\n何当归采菊，无日不思莼。\n秋色丹枫冷，西风白发新。\n翩翩鸿鹄气，千里去无垠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春和方子及病中见示之作","author":"佘翔","text":"汉京新改岁，怪尔避风尘。\n伏枕原非病，裁诗最有神。\n江山含紫气，梅柳斗青春。\n憔悴还如昨，谁怜泽畔人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题九鲤湖仝郭士龙林翌甫作","author":"佘翔","text":"琳宫高缥缈，登眺若飞翰。\n地僻藤萝古，潭深日月寒。\n石床空有藓，金灶已无丹。\n采药从兹去，胡麻或可餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食病起寄郑文蔚陈尧勋姚巽卿","author":"佘翔","text":"落落天涯客，春风病未瘳。\n此生扶药饵，故国梦松楸。\n对雨逢寒食，经年拥敝裘。\n王孙芳草路，何处不堪愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金子鲁席上留别孤山社诸君","author":"佘翔","text":"已结陶潜社，还看谢眺山。\n一尊楼阁别，孤客海天宽。\n金石心难变，江湖鬓已斑。\n武陵良月夜，风雨未堪攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠屠纬真","author":"佘翔","text":"何年辞建礼，天地老黄冠。\n书著藏名岳，家贫服大丹。\n西湖双桂棹，东海一渔竿。\n回首长安日，浮云梦里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏谢娼蝶裙是贞吉王孙所贻","author":"佘翔","text":"鲛鮹新出海，六幅制为裙。\n拓得滕王蝶，妆成峡女云。\n幽香春入梦，微步水生纹。\n解咏空中雪，谢家自不群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻林兆伦入九鲤诗以怀之","author":"佘翔","text":"闻尔寻真去，何山第几重。\n仙禽翔缥缈，大药采芙蓉。\n梦醒寒潭水，心清晓月钟。\n所嗟羁物役，徒想白云踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送康孟担游吴越","author":"佘翔","text":"芳草春晴候，看君赋远征。\n岭云寒傍马，堤柳暗鸣莺。\n酒湿鲛人泪，歌含郢客情。\n相知劳问讯，白首卧柴荆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊有怀","author":"佘翔","text":"晚泊弋阳溪，孤舟望里迷。\n桃花千树乱，杜宇数声啼。\n积雨沉渔火，回风咽鼓鼙。\n美人山水调，心折大江西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛丘宿方子嗣宗馆中","author":"佘翔","text":"久客辞梁苑，长途入宛丘。\n故人一握手，千里散离愁。\n秉烛寒砧夜，开尊片月秋。\n翻思桃叶渡，系马醉青楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪司马招入桃源赏桂同吴翁晋苏君昭汪仲淹分赋得林字","author":"佘翔","text":"桃源残暑退，城郭澹秋阴。\n玉露分河汉，天香散桂林。\n王孙招隐赋，公子采芳心。\n偃蹇空山曲，攀援意转深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答王百谷","author":"佘翔","text":"丛林寒夜别，明月寄新篇。\n君自纫兰佩，余仍拍酒船。\n百年贫傲世，半偈老逃禅。\n欲下高斋榻，莺花二月天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林邦介溪上别业","author":"佘翔","text":"一水抱村流，门临杜若洲。\n桃花停上骑，莲叶命扁舟。\n波荡千峰影，风回六月秋。\n西园名邺下，词赋重应刘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得紫阳洞","author":"佘翔","text":"石洞俯崔嵬，龙蛇绣碧苔。\n五丁何日凿，二酉此中开。\n度索花仍发，浮丘鹤不回。\n胡麻如可饭，长啸入天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读黄亨夫万玉山房稿赋赠","author":"佘翔","text":"曾谏长杨猎，翻为泽畔吟。\n幽兰搴作佩，流水咽鸣琴。\n天地飞扬态，山林偃蹇心。\n若非同调者，白雪几知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"片帆初度峡，一上钓龙台。\n睥睨三山出，辘轳万井开。\n披襟下白鸟，散发步苍苔。\n稍喜风尘静，谁当保障才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"落魄馀双鬓，城隅问故人。\n庭阴蕉叶老，秋色菊花新。\n陋巷嗟何事，浮云笑此身。\n床头多绿酒，莫厌客来频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"秋色正摇落，山山柿叶黄。\n那堪当逆旅，况复是重阳。\n猿断沧江月，鸦啼老树霜。\n不知孤馆客，何处泣干将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"节序逢青女，他乡未授衣。\n颜容愁里改，形影梦中归。\n此日徒餐菊，何山可采薇。\n却怜同病者，迢递暮云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"青霜沾夜草，对此暗销魂。\n短榻寒秋水，孤灯掩荜门。\n途穷营桂玉，泪尽隘乾坤。\n安得冥寥子，论心酒一樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其六","author":"佘翔","text":"西风吹万籁，城郭起秋涛。\n病色依双树，愁心感二毛。\n香生黄菊细，寒傍白云高。\n归去衡门下，凭谁读离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其七","author":"佘翔","text":"落叶纷如雨，愁人独倚楼。\n千峰明远水，一鸟下沧洲。\n湖海频相望，神仙未可求。\n欲歌招隐句，乘月弄扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其八","author":"佘翔","text":"越王台上望，秋色最堪怜。\n五虎罗青嶂，双鸿破碧天。\n芙蓉充杂佩，蟋蟀伴孤眠。\n欲觅知音者，雷阳路几千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其九","author":"佘翔","text":"垂老长为客，愁心夜雨多。\n绨袍谁复恋，白石自长歌。\n薜荔侵荒径，梧桐冷碧柯。\n披衣待明发，归思满烟萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋安馆中纪怀十首 其十","author":"佘翔","text":"长铗歌鱼日，萧萧两鬓斑。\n行云空入梦，倦鸟自知还。\n汉浦怀仙佩，菱花对玉颜。\n不知秋色里，几度望三山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠金子鲁开府 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"大楚劳分镇，全闽重策勋。\n虎符娴妙略，龙剑静妖氛。\n白羽摇山月，朱旗拂海云。\n辕门无别事，传檄草雄文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠金子鲁开府 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"牙帐开青甸，鸾旗下绛霄。\n星屯平野戍，月涌大江潮。\n竹箭千章合，桃花万骑骄。\n治书铃阁暇，清问到渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜同陈子卿集黄尧衢宅观菊","author":"佘翔","text":"玉树风初冷，萧然白发新。\n忽投江夏宅，又得杜陵人。\n纫佩怀湘女，飧英笑楚臣。\n何嫌欢秉烛，斗酒夜相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日康孟担过访薜荔园","author":"佘翔","text":"一径春阴里，松萝白日昏。\n若非高士驾，谁到故侯门。\n竹下诗偏秀，垆头酒未浑。\n莫言供给少，枕藉有芳荪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集郑文蔚草堂同尚晋拱元作","author":"佘翔","text":"秋色回丛桂，开尊咏楚骚。\n青云谁附骥，白眼一持螯。\n露冷花阴月，风生树杪涛。\n子真栖谷口，何处弋鸿毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登滕王阁","author":"佘翔","text":"高阁秋逾迥，寒潭影自深。\n君王不可见，过客一登临。\n车骑风烟散，笙歌栋宇沉。\n捲帘看暮雨，依旧洒城阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日燕子矶即事","author":"佘翔","text":"燕子枕江流，随波上下浮。\n天分吴楚堑，地控帝王州。\n网罟渔人集，帆樯估客愁。\n白云尊酒尽，一啸秣陵秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄屠田叔","author":"佘翔","text":"芳春已二月，偃蹇一狂夫。\n风雨花开落，关山雁有无。\n清言怀玉屑，傲吏对冰壶。\n欲买扁舟去，蓬蒿病未苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仝郑文蔚饮水亭作","author":"佘翔","text":"水曲花偏丽，柴门客到稀。\n藤萝盟不负，鸥鹭浴相依。\n半醉眠芳草，长吟望翠微。\n柳条春欲暮，肯令赏心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜仝吴湛之陈汝鉴过康孟担草堂","author":"佘翔","text":"汗漫浑无事，杖藜向尔投。\n幽兰纷薄暮，南斗耿清秋。\n秉烛窥玄草，倾壶醉白头。\n兴阑从去住，霜月夜悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄龙君善 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"忽得燕中信，嗟君有谤书。\n云霾丰狱剑，骥服太行车。\n赤县飞腾久，青云拓落初。\n桃花春水满，归混武陵渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄龙君善 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"楚材岂易得，偃蹇一长叹。\n遗爱歌南国，高名疾上官。\n五都怀白璧，九畹艺幽兰。\n且泛扁舟去，洞庭波浪宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄龙君善 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"黄山与白岳，几度兴流连。\n却笑缁衣客，翻憎贝锦篇。\n帆樯归楚日，鸡犬避秦年。\n若遇东来雁，裁诗寄綵笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄龙君善 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"文章窥屈宋，仕路转堪悲。\n去矣惊投杼，潸然泣染丝。\n白云瞻故里，青桂喜连枝。\n二酉探书罢，弹冠慰所知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游万山观仝郭次甫何长卿潘景升许去疾刘季然分得万字","author":"佘翔","text":"策杖叩玄关，缘崖穿野蔓。\n疑登黄鹤楼，更煮青精饭。\n御气瞻朝元，临风听吹万。\n眷兹汗漫游，岂负烟霞愿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水亭读凤皇山藏稿赠黄尧衢 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"把酒临流日，读君卷里诗。\n才华多幼妇，风雅是吾师。\n龙种千群失，凤毛五色披。\n凌云还有赋，况值好文时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水亭读凤皇山藏稿赠黄尧衢 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"蓬门深谢客，隐几意何如。\n偃蹇便科发，穷愁懒著书。\n松阴移短榻，鸟迹乱前除。\n幽独春相媚，无劳叹索居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水亭读凤皇山藏稿赠黄尧衢 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"刘伶深嗜酒，陆羽解烹茶。\n高士名犹在，吾生兴不赊。\n负薪吟野径，煮石待山家。\n若问浮生事，池塘暗落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋日詹淑正见过小酌","author":"佘翔","text":"寂寞掩柴荆，相过见汝情。\n伏天流大火，片雨下孤城。\n饥馑苏何日，江湖混此生。\n垆头聊共醉，坐听井梧声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]